# Appendix B: Import Chest (Screen 6)

**What it is:** a 3D "cold-storage crate" file input, restyled from a pixel-art chest to the app's light theme: frosted white-and-blue panels, brand-blue bands, a teal latch, and a dark navy interior with a teal glow. Hovering, focusing, or dragging a file over it opens the lid. Clicking opens the file picker. It is the real control for importing a CSV (see section 6.6), not decoration.

**Markup (`components/history/ImportChest.jsx`).** The file input must come before the chest and the text in the DOM, because the CSS uses sibling selectors.

```jsx
<div className="cc-import">
  <div className={`cc-chest-stage ${isDragOver ? "is-dragover" : ""}`} data-state={state}
       onDragOver={onDragOver} onDragLeave={onDragLeave} onDrop={onDrop}>
    <input type="file" className="cc-file-input" accept=".csv,text/csv"
           aria-label="Import a report CSV" onChange={onFile} />
    <div className="cc-chest" aria-hidden="true">
      <div className="cc-part cc-base">
        {["front","back","left","right","bottom","top"].map(s =>
          <div key={s} className={`cc-side cc-base-${s}`} />)}
      </div>
      <div className="cc-part cc-lid">
        {["front","back","left","right","bottom","top"].map(s =>
          <div key={s} className={`cc-side cc-lid-${s}`} />)}
        <div className="cc-latch">
          {["front","back","left","right","top","bottom"].map(s =>
            <div key={s} className={`cc-latch-f cc-latch-${s}`} />)}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p className="cc-chest-text" aria-live="polite">{label}</p>
  </div>
</div>
```

Labels by state: idle "Drop a report CSV or click", drag-over "Release to import", importing "Reading file...", success "Imported 5 records", error "Could not import". After success or error, return to idle after 4 seconds, and show details in the Import result list underneath. Keep the lid open while importing (add `is-dragover`-equivalent class `is-busy`).

**`styles/chest.css`:**

```css
.cc-import {
  --w: 140px;
  --d: 140px;
  --h-base: 100px;
  --h-lid: 40px;
  --chest-scale: 0.8;

  --cc-panel: #F4F8FF;
  --cc-panel-hi: #FFFFFF;
  --cc-panel-lo: #DCE8FB;
  --cc-band: var(--brand-blue);
  --cc-band-deep: var(--brand-blue-deep);
  --cc-void: #0F1B30;
  --cc-glow: rgba(34, 184, 167, 0.55);

  --cc-latch-light: #B8F0E8;
  --cc-latch-base: var(--teal);
  --cc-latch-dark: #17897D;
  --cc-latch-outline: #0E5F57;

  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  width: 100%;
}

.cc-chest-stage {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 260px;
  height: 250px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  perspective: 1200px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  transition: box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
}
.cc-chest-stage:focus-within,
.cc-chest-stage.is-dragover {
  background: var(--soft-blue);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(57, 120, 246, 0.35);
}

/* Invisible real file input covering the whole stage */
.cc-file-input {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  opacity: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.cc-chest {
  position: relative;
  width: var(--w);
  height: calc(var(--h-base) + var(--h-lid));
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  transform: scale(var(--chest-scale)) rotateX(-24deg) rotateY(-40deg);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.cc-part {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  width: var(--w);
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
}
.cc-base { top: var(--h-lid); height: var(--h-base); }
.cc-lid {
  top: 0;
  height: var(--h-lid);
  transform-origin: 50% var(--h-lid) -70px;
  transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.2, 0.4, 1);
}

/* Lid opens on hover, keyboard focus, drag-over, and while busy */
.cc-file-input:hover ~ .cc-chest .cc-lid,
.cc-file-input:focus-visible ~ .cc-chest .cc-lid,
.cc-chest-stage.is-dragover .cc-lid,
.cc-chest-stage[data-state="importing"] .cc-lid {
  transform: rotateX(100deg);
}
.cc-file-input:active ~ .cc-chest .cc-lid { transform: rotateX(110deg); }

/* Frosted crate panels with soft plank lines and brand-blue bands */
.cc-side {
  position: absolute;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background-color: var(--cc-panel);
  border: 8px solid var(--cc-band);
  background-image:
    repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      var(--cc-panel-hi) 0px, var(--cc-panel-hi) 3px,
      transparent 3px, transparent 18px,
      var(--cc-panel-lo) 18px, var(--cc-panel-lo) 20px
    ),
    repeating-linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0px, transparent 10px,
      rgba(57, 120, 246, 0.05) 10px, rgba(57, 120, 246, 0.05) 20px
    );
}

/* Gentle directional lighting (kept light so the theme stays airy) */
.cc-base-front, .cc-lid-front { filter: brightness(1); }
.cc-base-left,  .cc-lid-left  { filter: brightness(0.96); }
.cc-base-right, .cc-lid-right { filter: brightness(0.9); }
.cc-base-back,  .cc-lid-back  { filter: brightness(0.82); }
.cc-lid-top { filter: brightness(1.04); }

/* Base geometry */
.cc-base-front  { width: var(--w); height: var(--h-base); transform: translateZ(70px); }
.cc-base-back   { width: var(--w); height: var(--h-base); transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(70px); }
.cc-base-left   { width: var(--d); height: var(--h-base); transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(70px); }
.cc-base-right  { width: var(--d); height: var(--h-base); transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(70px); }
.cc-base-bottom {
  width: var(--w); height: var(--d);
  transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(calc(var(--h-base) - 70px));
  background: var(--cc-band-deep);
}
/* Hollow, softly glowing inside */
.cc-base-top {
  width: var(--w); height: var(--d);
  transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(70px);
  background-color: var(--cc-void);
  background-image: none;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px var(--cc-glow);
}

/* Lid geometry */
.cc-lid-front { width: var(--w); height: var(--h-lid); transform: translateZ(70px); }
.cc-lid-back  { width: var(--w); height: var(--h-lid); transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(70px); }
.cc-lid-left  { width: var(--d); height: var(--h-lid); transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(70px); }
.cc-lid-right { width: var(--d); height: var(--h-lid); transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(70px); }
.cc-lid-top   { width: var(--w); height: var(--d); transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(70px); }
.cc-lid-bottom {
  width: var(--w); height: var(--d);
  transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(calc(var(--h-lid) - 70px));
  background-color: var(--cc-panel-lo);
  background-image: none;
  border: 8px solid var(--cc-band);
}

/* Teal metal latch */
.cc-latch {
  position: absolute;
  width: 20px;
  height: 40px;
  left: calc(50% - 10px);
  top: calc(var(--h-lid) - 20px);
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  transform: translateZ(75px);
}
.cc-latch-f {
  position: absolute;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background-color: var(--cc-latch-base);
  border: 2px solid var(--cc-latch-outline);
}
.cc-latch-front {
  width: 20px; height: 40px;
  transform: translateZ(5px);
  background: linear-gradient(
    to bottom,
    var(--cc-latch-light) 0px, var(--cc-latch-light) 10px,
    var(--cc-latch-base) 10px, var(--cc-latch-base) 28px,
    var(--cc-latch-dark) 28px
  );
}
.cc-latch-back   { width: 20px; height: 40px; transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(5px); }
.cc-latch-left   { width: 10px; height: 40px; left: 5px; transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(10px); background: var(--cc-latch-dark); }
.cc-latch-right  { width: 10px; height: 40px; left: 5px; transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(10px); background: var(--cc-latch-dark); }
.cc-latch-top    { width: 20px; height: 10px; top: 15px; transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(20px); background: var(--cc-latch-light); }
.cc-latch-bottom { width: 20px; height: 10px; top: 15px; transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(20px); background: var(--cc-latch-dark); }

/* Status text (uses the app font, not a monospace pixel font) */
.cc-chest-text {
  margin: 24px 0 0;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 240px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  transition: transform 0.2s, color 0.2s;
}
.cc-file-input:hover ~ .cc-chest-text,
.cc-chest-stage.is-dragover .cc-chest-text {
  color: var(--brand-blue);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.cc-chest-stage[data-state="success"] .cc-chest-text { color: var(--success); }
.cc-chest-stage[data-state="error"] .cc-chest-text { color: var(--danger); }

/* Reduced motion: the lid still opens, but instantly. */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .cc-lid, .cc-chest-text, .cc-chest-stage { transition: none; }
}
```

Also duplicate the reduced-motion rules under `.reduce-motion` (the Settings toggle). On touch devices, which have no hover, the lid opens on tap-down (`:active`) while the file picker opens, and on drag-over where supported. Because the chest is purely visual, the real input handles accessibility: it needs the `aria-label`, a visible focus ring on the stage, and Enter or Space to open the picker.

